  m_text: "Art and animation - Created by me\n\nBonus round (Start) - 8bit-style
    bonus effect by complex_waveform -- https://freesound.org/s/213149/ -- License:
    Attribution 4.0\n\nBonus round (Countdown) - Countdown sound effect 8-bit by
    Lesiakower (pixabay)\n\nFont -  Jersey 10 by Sarah Cadigan-Fried (Google Fonts)\n\nGame
    Over - 8-bit gane over sound effect by Lesiakower (pixabay) \n\nMain Menu Music
    - GameStart by u_xmiigyhi46 (pixabay)\n\nMultiplier - 8bit-powerup4 from Ultimate
    8BIT SFX Library Vol 1 by mOsh (itch.io)\n\nPause / Resume - sfx_sounds_pause3_in
    / sfx_sounds_pause3_out from The Essential Retro Video Game Sound Effects \nCollection
    by Juhani Junkala (Open Game art)\n\nReload - Retro Weapon Reload Best A 03 from
    FreeSFX by Kronbits (itch.io)\n\nStartup countdown - 8-bit Countdown Ready /
    Go by JapanYoshiTheGamer (freesound.org)\n\nAny remaining uncredited SFX - Created
    by me"
